  "body": "Discover this rare opportunity to own a prime waterfront property with direct access from your own front garden and shell-lined path to Orewa Beach's golden sands, along with thriving cafes, restaurants and bars directly across the road - the position and potential here are undeniable!\r\n\r\nThere's something wonderfully nostalgic about this home, treasured by the same family for 34 years, built of solid concrete, with dark timber accents from another era. Yet beyond the nostalgia lies exceptional potential: modernise the interiors, retain the character you love, and create your own version of this very special coastal home.\r\n\r\nThe layout works beautifully, with an open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, and a light-filled conservatory that flows directly to the outdoors, making it perfect for entertaining and inviting you to soak up the uninterrupted views of Orewa Beach.\r\n\r\nUpstairs features three bedrooms and two bathrooms, with the master suite offering a stunning outlook. A hidden staircase leads to an attic-style room with breathtaking views, previously used as an artist's studio - perfect for creating, or as a hideaway for children, or simply a serene escape. As one of just three townhouses, it offers no body corporate fees and the potential to make it your own.\r\n\r\nThe property's status under the Auckland Unitary Plan's Business - Town Centre zoning adds a layer of versatility, opening up exciting possibilities for residential, commercial, or mixed-use developments (all subject to local council guidelines), inspiring confidence in its future potential.\r\n\r\nFor families, this property represents a legacy where memories can be woven into the shoreline, while investors will appreciate the strategic landholding in a thriving coastal township.\r\n\r\nWhile Orewa's vibrant community is just a step away, the property itself offers a private oasis with only your garden and the beach in sight.\r\n\r\nThis is a genuine beachfront home with charm, a canvas ready for your modern twist, or a chance to retain its retro Mediterranean appeal. Either way, it's a rare chance to secure a distinctive piece of Orewa beachfront living with everything at your fingertips. \r\n\r\nCall for more information",
